WEBVTT - P001 ChatGPT x Google Connect · on-screen text

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
ChatGPT ab tumhara GMAIL bhi padhega!

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Ruko. Purane wale Plugins band ho chuke. Ab ye Settings → Plugins me milta hai.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Connect karna = 4 steps: 1 Settings kholo · 2 Plugins/Apps · 3 Gmail chuno · 4 Connect → Google pe Allow

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Gmail jud gaya to? — "Aaj ke important mail batao" · "Iska reply draft karo"

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Drive: "Meri report dhundo, summary do" · Calendar: "Kal mera din kaisa hai?"

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Ek dhyaan: Permission padh ke Allow karo. Disconnect kabhi bhi, Settings se.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
ChatGPT = sirf chat nahi, tumhara Assistant. Pehle Gmail try karo. Save kar lo!
